============================================================

The current project has completed substantial groundwork for:

    - layered environmental resources
    - field/reservoir conservation
    - indiscriminate vent transfer with bonded-state preservation
    - physical access and acquisition
    - resource perception
    - genome-based desirability
    - spatial memory
    - material representation
