The next major design task is therefore not to add arbitrary mechanics, but to deliberately finish the unresolved COMBINE mathematics and then integrate it into organism behavior.

============================================================
32. NEXT DESIGN PRIORITY
============================================================

The next major system should be COMBINE.

Correct sequence:

    1. Define desired physical behavior.
    2. Derive candidate equations.
    3. Test equations in isolation.
    4. Reject equations that produce pathological incentives.
    5. Select the simplest equation set that produces the desired behavior.
    6. Document the equations here.
    7. Implement them in the combine subsystem.
    8. Test integration.
    9. Only then allow evolution to discover and exploit COMBINE.

Do not reverse this order merely to make the simulator "do more".

